#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "A CV downloaded as a Europass file, for a portal or a service that reads the European CV format: its entries and the details it prints, in its language. What Europass has no place for is said beside the download. Switched off, the download is not offered and its address answers as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "CV yang diunduh sebagai berkas Europass, untuk portal atau layanan yang membaca format CV Eropa: entri-entrinya dan detail yang dicetaknya, dalam bahasanya. Apa yang tidak memiliki tempat di Europass dinyatakan di samping unduhan. Jika dinonaktifkan, unduhan tidak ditawarkan dan alamatnya menjawab seolah-olah tidak ada apa-apa di sana."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "A CV downloaded as a JSON Resume file, the open format many CV tools and themes read: its entries and the details it prints. What the format has no place for is said beside the download. Switched off, the download is not offered and its address answers as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "CV yang diunduh sebagai berkas JSON Resume, format terbuka yang dibaca banyak alat dan tema CV: entri-entrinya dan detail yang dicetaknya. Apa yang tidak memiliki tempat di format itu dinyatakan di samping unduhan. Jika dinonaktifkan, unduhan tidak ditawarkan dan alamatnya menjawab seolah-olah tidak ada apa-apa di sana."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Contacts, companies and your own details as .vcf cards, and a card file read in. Switched off, the downloads and the import are not offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "Kontak, perusahaan, dan data Anda sendiri sebagai kartu .vcf, serta berkas kartu yang dibaca masuk. Jika dimatikan, unduhan dan impor tidak ditawarkan dan alamatnya menjawab seolah-olah tidak ada apa-apa di sana."

